<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"  xml:id="chapter-3-intro">
  <title>Week 3</title>
  <introduction>

    <p>
      At the end of this week you should be able to...
    </p>
    <objectives>
      <ul>
        <li>describe properties of characters and Strings</li>
        <li>recognize basic character encodings and escapes</li>
        <li>use a REPL to evaluate character and String expressions</li>
        <li>describe properties of static methods</li>
        <li>develop programs that include static method definitions</li>
        <li>trace the flow of control during the execution of a program using calls to static methods</li>
      </ul>
    </objectives>
  </introduction>
  
  <xi:include href="sec-text-data.ptx"/>
  <xi:include href="sec-string-operations.ptx"/>
  <xi:include href="sec-static-method-definitions.ptx"/>
</chapter>

